   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A represents the digit 10.</p>\n<p>B represents the digit 11.</p>\n<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 3 + 6 = 9</p>\n<p>In base 12: 9</p>\n<p>One’s place: 9</p>\n<p>Carry: No need</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 11 + 0 = 11</p>\n<p>In base 12: B</p>\n<p>This column: B</p>\n<p>Carry: No need</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 4 + 11 = 15 = 12 + 3</p>\n<p>In base 12: 13</p>\n<p>This column: 13</p>\n<p>Carry: You don’t need to carry because there are no more columns.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"13{\\text{B}}{9_{12}}\"></span></p>"
    },
